t have enough Originium engines. People never change, even after centuries.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Does not count towards the defeated enemies counter","Grants 1 Buoyancy when on a Levitatable Zone"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.5,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":0,"def":0,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1}},"skybuster_soda":{"slug":"skybuster_soda","name":"Skybuster Soda","icon":"/enemies-icons/Skybuster Soda.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Shake the bottle vigorously for three hundred seconds then pry the cap open according to the instructions, and it will shoot into the sky with immense force. Don't worry, the bottle is made of high-toughness acrylic that will not break easily.\nAs for the soda inside... does anyone actually buy it for the soda?","abilities":["Flying unit.","Gradually accelerates when moving, but loses HP over time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":5000,"atk":350,"def":100,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"skyhowl_vacuum":{"slug":"skyhowl_vacuum","name":"Skyhowl Vacuum","icon":"/enemies-icons/Skyhowl Vacuum.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"For other appliances, the ability to fly is just a gimmick. For vacuum cleaners, the ability to fly is a revolutionary breakthrough, allowing it to vacuum the ceiling with ease.\nPlease follow the instructions in the safety manual if it catches your hair as it flies over your head.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Periodically searches for nearby Balloons, Powerful Balloons or allied units and attacks them for some time while absorbing certain SP"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":60